      "cooked": "<p>I’ve got tonight to finish my Tachyon costume!  I had a couple of pain-in-the-rear setbacks, but I think I’ll have it done in time.  Sleep is totally overrated, right?!  This is my second comic-y spandex costume and I 'm so over stretchy fabric that requires lining with a differently stretchy fabric &gt;_&lt;</p>\n<p>This will be my first Gen Con so I’m super excited!</p>",
